title: SPD Party Congress
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1928 and month = 2
set-jump: post_congress

# the low priority means that this event is only seen after all other events are resolved for the month.
# note: z_coalition = z_celation + (pro_cepublic/2); z_coalition *= 1.25 if z_faction_leader == "Joos";

= SPD Party Congress, [+ month : month +] [+ year +]

The Party congress is to be held now.

- @faction_algorithm: May we do our best...

@faction_algorithm
on-arrival: {!

Q.left_votes = left_strength;
Q.center_votes = center_strength;
Q.reformist_votes = reformist_strength;
Q.labor_votes = labor_strength;
Q.neorevisionist_votes = neorevisionist_strength;
Q.total_factions = Q[faction + '_votes']

// Normalize to percentage
Q[faction + '_votes'] = Math.round((Q[faction + '_votes'] / total_factions) * 100);
console.log(`[${faction}] normalized vote %:`, Q[faction + '_votes']);
!}

- @post_congress: See the results

@post_congress
on-arrival: {!
Q.marxist_unity = Q.left_c+Q.center_c;
Q.lassalean_unity = Q.reformist_c+Q.neorevisionist_c;
Q.pragmatic_unity = Q.center_c+Q.reformist_c;
!}
on-display: {!
if (!Q.neorevisionism) {
    data = [
        {   "id": "left",
            "legend": "Left",
            "name": "Left",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.left_votes),
        },
        {
            "id": "center",
            "legend": "Center",
            "name": "Center",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.center_votes),
        },
        {
            "id": "labor",
            "legend": "Labor",
            "name": "Labor",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.labor_votes),
        },
        {
            "id": "reformist",
            "legend": "Reformists",
            "name": "Reformists",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.reformist_votes),
        },
];
}
else {
    data = [
        {   "id": "left",
            "legend": "Left",
            "name": "Left",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.left_votes),
        },
        {
            "id": "center",
            "legend": "Center",
            "name": "Center",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.center_votes),
        },
        {
            "id": "labor",
            "legend": "Labor",
            "name": "Labor",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.labor_votes),
        },
        {
            "id": "reformist",
            "legend": "Reformists",
            "name": "Reformists",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.reformist_votes),
        },
        {
            "id": "neorevisionist",
            "legend": "Neorevisionists",
            "name": "Neorevisionists",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.neorevisionist_votes),
        },
];
}
if (window && d3) {
    var width = 500; 
    var height = 500;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50; 
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("reichstag").style.height = screenWidth/2 + "px";
    } 

    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#reichstag").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}

= Election results

{!<svg id="reichstag" style="width: 500px; height: 250px;"> </svg>!}

{!<table>!} 
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote share</td><td>% Change</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#9c0000'> </div> !} Left: {!</td><td>!} [+ left_c +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_left +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#e30000'> </div> !} Center: {!</td><td>!} [+ center_c +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_center +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#ff681d'> </div> !} Labor: {!</td><td>!} [+ labor_c +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_labor +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#ff6ba9'> </div> !} Reformists: {!</td><td>!} [+ reformist_c +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_reformist +] {!</td></tr>!}

[? if neorevisionism == 1 : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#ff14a5'> </div> !}Neorevisionists: {!</td><td>!} [+ neorevisionist_c +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_neorevisionist +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

- @coalition_menu: Elect a leader

@coalition_menu

- @marxist_unity: Rudolf Breitscheid
- @left_majority: Kurt Rosenfeld
- @center_majority: Rudolf Hilferding
- @pragmatic_unity: Otto Wels
- @reformist_majority: Otto Braun
- @neorevisionist_majority: Carlo Mierendorff
- @labor_majority: Theodor Leipart
- @lassalean_unity: Carl Severing

@marxist_unity
choose-if: marxist_unity >= 50
subtitle: Rudolf Breitscheid is supported by the Left and Center ([+ marxist_unity +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: Rudolf Breitscheid lacks support and is forced to withdraw
on-arrival: reformist_strength -= 5; neorevisionist_strength -= 5; labor_strength -= 5; left_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 5

Rudolf Breitscheid is elected as Chairman

@left_majority  
choose-if: left_c >= 50  
subtitle: Kurt Rosenfeld is support by solely the Left ([+ left_c +]%)  
unavailable-subtitle: Kurt Rosenfeld lakcs a majority and endorses Breitscheid.
on-arrival: left_strength += 10; reformist_dissent += 10; neorevisionist_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5

Kurt Rosenfeld wins in an upset.

@center_majority  
choose-if: center_c >= 50  
subtitle: Center ([+ center_c +]%)  
unavailable-subtitle: Lacking support, Hilferding endorses Wels.
on-arrival: center_strength += 10; left_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5

Rudolf Hilferding is elevated from a theoretical to a practical role in the party.

@reformist_majority  
choose-if: reformist_c >= 50  
subtitle: Reformists ([+ reformist_c +]%)  
unavailable-subtitle: Otto Braun does not have enough support and endorses Severing.
on-arrival: reformist_strength += 10; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5

Otto Braun is elected as Chairman.

@neorevisionist_majority  
choose-if: neorevisionist_c >= 50  
view-if: neorevisionists
subtitle: Neorevisionists ([+ neorevisionist_c +]%)  
unavailable-subtitle: Carlo Mierendorff opts to endorse Severing.
on-arrival: neorevisionist_strength += 10; left_dissent += 15; center_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5

Carlo Mierendorff wins, becoming leader of the party.

@labor_majority  
choose-if: labor_c >= 50  
subtitle: Labor ([+ labor_c +]%)  
unavailable-subtitle: The majority of the party still does not believe Laborites should lead it.
on-arrival: labor_strength += 10; center_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5

Theodor Leipart wins the chairmanship, cementing Labor's place.

@pragmatic_unity
choose-if: pragmatic_unity >= 50
subtitle: Center + Reformists ([+ pragmatic_unity +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: Otto Wels lacks a majority.
on-arrival: center_strength += 5; reformist_strength += 5

Otto Wels, expectedly, wins the chairmanship.


@lassalean_unity  
choose-if: lassalean_unity >= 50
view-if: neorevisionists
subtitle: Reformists + Neorevisionists ([+ lassalean_unity +]%)  
unavailable-subtitle: Carl Severing does not have enough support.
on-arrival: reformist_strength += 5; neorevisionist_strength += 5; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 5

Carl Severing has been elected Chairman.
